==Icelandic==
===Adverb===
'''þá'''

# [[then]], the past
#: '''''Þá''' var ég ungur maður.''
#:: I was a young man '''then'''.
# [[then]]
#: '''''Þá''' fer ég bara!''
#:: '''Then''' I'll just leave!
#: ''Hvað gerirðu '''þá'''?''
#:: What will you do '''then'''?

